## Dk.OpamLock

Only the current OpamLock revision ships. The retired Export@1.0.0-@1.1.5
ladder lives in pre-2026-08 release tags and git history (see dk.u
"## Assets" for the keep-latest-only policy).

  $ run-function CommonsLang_OCaml.Dk.OpamLock.Export@1.1.6 -f ${RUNTIME}/OpamLock.Export-1.1.6.zip
  \test(pass)
  \dk.object(abi: "Release.Linux_x86_64", value-id: "omke7uep5ewhhsetaukr643o7sbz745hiafdwzgz62zx6raoxyy6a")\;


## Dk.OpamBuild

Only the current OpamBuild revision ships. The retired Export@1.0.0-@1.0.15
ladder lives in pre-2026-08 release tags and git history (see dk.u
"## Assets" for the keep-latest-only policy).

  $ run-function CommonsLang_OCaml.Dk.OpamBuild.Export@1.0.16 -f ${RUNTIME}/OpamBuild.Export-1.0.16.zip
  \test(pass)
  \dk.object(abi: "Release.Linux_x86_64", value-id: "ox2yguwbuo7ev3o5ovs5vcjgsljpqjev73hi6ze6isy6mmksrfasq")\;
